["2025 AD 93"]}, {"t": 7140, "time": "01:59:00", "artist": "Andikaa Saputraa", "title": "Sound Jj, Vol. 46", "conf": "low", "links": [{"label": "bandcamp", "url": "https://bandcamp.com/search?q=Andikaa+Saputraa+Sound+Jj%2C+Vol.+46", "search": true}, {"label": "youtube", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Andikaa+Saputraa+Sound+Jj%2C+Vol.+46", "search": true}, {"label": "soundcloud", "url": "https://soundcloud.com/search?q=Andikaa+Saputraa+Sound+Jj%2C+Vol.+46", "search": true}, {"label": "spotify", "url": "https://open.spotify.com/search/Andikaa+Saputraa+Sound+Jj%2C+Vol.+46", "search": true}, {"label": "apple", "url": "https://music.apple.com/au/search?term=Andikaa+Saputraa+Sound+Jj%2C+Vol.+46", "search": true}, {"label": "deezer", "url": "https://www.deezer.com/search/Andikaa+Saputraa+Sound+Jj%2C+Vol.+46", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=Andikaa+Saputraa+Sound+Jj%2C+Vol.+46&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": []}], "counts": {"high": 0, "mid": 9, "low": 6}, "transcripts": [{"start": "00:13:01", "end": "00:14:39", "text": "Hello, you tuned in to M5 on FBi Radio. I'd like to take a moment to acknowledge the traditional Custodians of the land that we're broadcasting from here today. The Gadigal people of the Eora Nation. And pay my respects to Elders past, present and emerging. Sovereignty was never ceded. This is, was and always will be Aboriginal land. back with another local guest producer this week having a guest mix tonight from one million dollars who some of you may know is e3p they have a long history at fbi as a broadcaster and with dance class and are so well loved in our community so it's really great to have some of more of their productions out and about in the world at the top there we heard shell and it's off a two-track ep called shell angel which was originally composed for soft center i believe yeah stick around we're gonna keep it sort of electronic ambient for a little bit At the top there, we had Horse Opera by Hood. It's off a remix album. And, of course, we had one from $1 Million that was number one shell. And underneath me right now is Phase One by Continuum. Check back in soon."}, {"start": "00:19:58", "end": "00:20:22", "text": "He called this exercise tentative d'épuisement d'un lieu parisien, an attempt at exhausting a place in Paris, a wonderful exercise in observation."}, {"start": "00:30:20", "end": "00:31:02", "text": "Hello, you're listening to M5 on FBi Radio. Track underneath me at the moment is AO by Girl Scat Cookies. Above that we had At Night, All Blood Is Black by Ealing, who is also the mixing and mastering engineer on Sims Records. Above that we have Pablo's Eye with October 74. and this is my last track before i hand it over to a guest mix from our artist this week one million dollars i hope you're enjoying some really nice things to come"}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:00:45"}, "track": {"title": "Shell", "artists": [{"name": "$1 Million"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:12:32"}, "track": {"title": "Horse Opera", "artists": [{"name": "Hood"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:12:47"}, "track": {"title": "Phase One", "artists": [{"name": "Continuum"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:20:22"}, "track": {"title": "October '74", "artists": [{"name": "Pablo's Eye"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:22:22"}, "track": {"title": "At Night, All Blood Is Black", "artists": [{"name": "ealing"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:26:21"}, "track": {"title": "AO", "artists": [{"name": "Girl Scat Cookies"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted":